    # The source/capture pass already adapted this exact operand and bound
    # its root. Fields and INDEX share that saved grammar and semantic fold;
    # neither a names-only adapter nor an alternative text parse belongs here.
    source_match: c.lm_compiler_use_fact_find(first, n, mi, @ source_use)
    # Early typing may already have resolved this operand before the
    # namespace/capture source-use traversal. Consume its SAME prepared
    # record by original run identity, never another grammar adapter.
